    "section": "23. Aircraft",
    "ruleNumber": "23.04",
    "summary": "AIRCRAFT units can never declare a charge, and their melee attacks may target only FLYING units. In the other direction, only FLYING units may pick AIRCRAFT units as charge targets, and only FLYING models may make melee attacks against AIRCRAFT units.",
